source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: A literal pipe splits the row into cells before any Monospace Span forms, in Jira and in jiro.
-- input.jira --
||h||
|{{a|b}}|
-- rendered.html --
<div class='table-wrap'>
<table class='confluenceTable'><tbody>
<tr>
<th class='confluenceTh'>h</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>{{a</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>b}}</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
</div>
-- want.md --
:::table
||h||
|{{a|b}}|
:::
